    <description>On manual/API Lead creation, defaults Brand from the operating user&apos;s AF_DefaultBrand__c (when identified and the field is still blank), and defaults City to &quot;Doha&quot; / Country to &quot;Qatar&quot; when the address block is blank. All three remain editable — this only fills gaps, never overwrites a value the creator already supplied.</description>
